  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large Dutch oven over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add the beef brisket and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped red bell pepper and cook until tender, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the star anise, tomato paste, beef broth, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the stew to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 2 1/2 hours.",
    "Remove the star anise pods and serve the stew hot, garnished with fresh parsley if desired."
